# Auto-deploy to Vercel

Vercel production for `ellz-luxe-fragranz` deploys from `main` on GitHub (`quasimawunyo/Ellz-Luxe-Fragranz`).

When a user task is done and it changed the repo:

1. Commit relevant files (never `.env.local`, credentials, or secrets).
2. `git push origin HEAD` (this project uses `main`).
3. Treat that push as the production deploy. Do not wait to be asked.

Skip commit/push only if there is nothing to ship, or the user said not to deploy this change.
